# Requests for the REST Client extension: click "Send Request" above each one.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Liveness: 200 with status, uptime and version
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Readiness: 200 if PostgreSQL answers, 503 if not (try it after `npm run db:down`)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Your own request ID comes back in the X-Request-Id response header
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-Request-Id: debug-samuel-001

### An unsafe request ID is ignored and replaced with a UUID
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-Request-Id: <script>alert(1)</script>

### Unknown route: 404 as application/problem+json
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets-that-do-not-exist

### Malformed JSON: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR, before any route runs
POST {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "missing closing brace"
